{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31739","headline":"寄孟协律 · 贾岛","name":"寄孟协律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有吊古泣，不泣向路岐。\n挥泪洒暮天，滴着桂树枝。\n别後冬节至，离心北风吹。\n坐孤雪扉夕，泉落石桥时。\n不惊猛虎啸，难辱君子词。\n欲酬空觉老，无以堪远持。\n迢嶤倚角窗，王屋悬清思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}